# Workers Static Assets redirects (same mechanism as site/_headers, which this
# deployment already honours). Rules apply only to requests the asset server
# handles. Never add a path the Worker routes itself (/mcp, /v1, /health; see
# run_worker_first in server/wrangler.jsonc): the rule would silently not fire.
# Every target must be a page or anchor that exists: site-accuracy.test.ts checks.
/benchmark /bench 301
/changelog /docs#changelog 301
/connect /#connect 301
/faq /#faq 301
/status /v1/status 301
